{"1630":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Disciples II: Rise of the Elves ","steam_appid":1630,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The award-winning series Disciples introduced a milestone in the game's very successful history; the introduction of a new race: The Elves. The Elven Race added a new dimension to the game and added countless hours of gameplay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t   Now that series has expanded further with Disciples II: Rise Of The Elves. This version features all of the campaigns found in the original and a brand new campaign that continues the storyline of the Elven Race. It also includes 14 new skirmish maps to test hone your skills.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\t\t\t\t   <strong>Key features<\/strong> <\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New campaign that continues the Elven Storyline<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    14 new skirmish maps to test gamer's skills  <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    5 playable races to choose from; the Empire; the Undead Hordes, the Mountain Clans, the Legions of the Damned, and the Elven Alliance <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    The Elven tech tree allows players to choose between Noble or Wild Elves increasing replayability <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    Over 200 individually animated unit types and over 100 different spells <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    Scenario editor to create your own adventures  <\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    Battle friends and enemies in multiplayer over LAN, Internet or Hot-Seat play<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t  <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T